<th id="S2.T2.2.12.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding-left:2.0pt;padding-right:2.0pt;">Jetson Orin Nano GPU (batch=4)<sup id="S2.T2.2.12.3.1" class="ltx_sup">‡</sup></th>
